  "document_type": "bible_chapter",
  "number": 35,
  "title": "Genesis 35",
  "display_title": "Genesis 35",
  "translation": "King James Version",
  "translationCode": "KJV",
  "bookId": "genesis",
  "book": "Genesis",
  "bookName": "Genesis",
  "bookOrder": 1,
  "testament": "old",
  "chapter": 35,
  "sortOrder": 1035,
  "verseCount": 29,
  "aliases": [
    "Gen",
    "Ge",
    "Gn"
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "And God said unto Jacob, Arise, go up to Bethel, and dwell there: and make there an altar unto God, that appeared unto thee when thou fleddest from the face of Esau thy brother.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "Then Jacob said unto his household, and to all that were with him, Put away the strange gods that are among you, and be clean, and change your garments:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "And let us arise, and go up to Bethel; and I will make there an altar unto God, who answered me in the day of my distress, and was with me in the way which I went.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "And they gave unto Jacob all the strange gods which were in their hand, and all their earrings which were in their ears; and Jacob hid them under the oak which was by Shechem.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "And they journeyed: and the terror of God was upon the cities that were round about them, and they did not pursue after the sons of Jacob.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "So Jacob came to Luz, which is in the land of Canaan, that is, Bethel, he and all the people that were with him.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "And he built there an altar, and called the place Elbethel: because there God appeared unto him, when he fled from the face of his brother.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "But Deborah Rebekah’s nurse died, and she was buried beneath Bethel under an oak: and the name of it was called Allonbachuth.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "And God appeared unto Jacob again, when he came out of Padanaram, and blessed him.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "And God said unto him, Thy name is Jacob: thy name shall not be called any more Jacob, but Israel shall be thy name: and he called his name Israel.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "And God said unto him, I am God Almighty: be fruitful and multiply; a nation and a company of nations shall be of thee, and kings shall come out of thy loins;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "And the land which I gave Abraham and Isaac, to thee I will give it, and to thy seed after thee will I give the land.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "And God went up from him in the place where he talked with him.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "And Jacob set up a pillar in the place where he talked with him, even a pillar of stone: and he poured a drink offering thereon, and he poured oil thereon.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "And Jacob called the name of the place where God spake with him, Bethel.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "And they journeyed from Bethel; and there was but a little way to come to Ephrath: and Rachel travailed, and she had hard labour.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "And it came to pass, when she was in hard labour, that the midwife said unto her, Fear not; thou shalt have this son also.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:17"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-018",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 18,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:18",
      "numberLabel": "18",
      "text": "And it came to pass, as her soul was in departing, (for she died) that she called his name Benoni: but his father called him Benjamin.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:18",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-019",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 19,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:19",
      "numberLabel": "19",
      "text": "And Rachel died, and was buried in the way to Ephrath, which is Bethlehem.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:19",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-020",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 20,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:20",
      "numberLabel": "20",
      "text": "And Jacob set a pillar upon her grave: that is the pillar of Rachel’s grave unto this day.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:20",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:20"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-021",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 21,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:21",
      "numberLabel": "21",
      "text": "And Israel journeyed, and spread his tent beyond the tower of Edar.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:21",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:21"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-022",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 22,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:22",
      "numberLabel": "22",
      "text": "And it came to pass, when Israel dwelt in that land, that Reuben went and lay with Bilhah his father’s concubine: and Israel heard it. Now the sons of Jacob were twelve:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:22",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:22"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-023",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 23,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:23",
      "numberLabel": "23",
      "text": "The sons of Leah; Reuben, Jacob’s firstborn, and Simeon, and Levi, and Judah, and Issachar, and Zebulun:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:23",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:23"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-024",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 24,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:24",
      "numberLabel": "24",
      "text": "The sons of Rachel; Joseph, and Benjamin:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:24",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:24"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-025",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 25,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:25",
      "numberLabel": "25",
      "text": "And the sons of Bilhah, Rachel’s handmaid; Dan, and Naphtali:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:25",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:25"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-026",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 26,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:26",
      "numberLabel": "26",
      "text": "And the sons of Zilpah, Leah’s handmaid; Gad, and Asher: these are the sons of Jacob, which were born to him in Padanaram.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:26",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:26"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-027",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 27,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:27",
      "numberLabel": "27",
      "text": "And Jacob came unto Isaac his father unto Mamre, unto the city of Arbah, which is Hebron, where Abraham and Isaac sojourned.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:27",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:27"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-028",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 28,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:28",
      "numberLabel": "28",
      "text": "And the days of Isaac were an hundred and fourscore years.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:28",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:28"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-029",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 29,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:35:29",
      "numberLabel": "29",
      "text": "And Isaac gave up the ghost, and died, and was gathered unto his people, being old and full of days: and his sons Esau and Jacob buried him.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 35:29",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:35:29"
      }
    }
  ],
  "source": {
